 **Parameters:**
-*   $\tau_{clip}$: Opacity threshold for culling. Default value is 0.3 [S1].
-*   $\tau_{prune}$: Opacity threshold used during the final training phase to prune triangles. Value not explicitly given, but used in [S2].
